      "name": "OCI Forwarder: Basic Metrics",
      "description": null,
      "widgets": [
        {
          "title": "",
          "layout": {
            "column": 1,
            "row": 1,
            "width": 6,
            "height": 6
          },
          "linkedEntityGuids": null,
          "visualization": {
            "id": "viz.markdown"
          },
          "rawConfiguration": {
            "text": "# README\n\n## About this page\nThis page displays the **basic-tier** `forwarder.*` custom metrics emitted by the [OCI Log Forwarder](https://github.com/newrelic/oci-log-integration) Function. These metrics are available when `metrics_tier` is set to `basic` or `advanced` in the Terraform configuration.\n\n## How to filter\n1. Select the OCI Function(s) you want to monitor using the **Function Name** variable above.\n2. All charts are faceted by `function_name` and `tenancy_name` so you can correlate metrics across tenancies.\n\n## Metrics on this page\n- **forwarder.invocations** \u2014 one count per function invocation, tagged with `status=success` or `status=error`.\n- **forwarder.records.received** \u2014 total OCI log records received from the incoming event payload.\n- **forwarder.records.delivered** \u2014 records successfully posted to the New Relic Logs API (tagged `status=success`).\n- **forwarder.records.dropped** \u2014 records lost due to a delivery error (tagged `reason=delivery_error`).\n- **forwarder.delivery.duration** \u2014 HTTP round-trip time (seconds) for each New Relic Logs API call, tagged with `status=success` or `status=error`.\n- **forwarder.pipeline.lag** \u2014 time in seconds between the OCI log event timestamp and when the function processed it.\n\n## Common dimensions\nAll metrics carry: `cloud`, `region`, `version`, `function_name`, `application_name`, `tenancy_name`, `compartment_name`."
          }
        },
        {
          "title": "Forwarder info",
          "layout": {
            "column": 7,
            "row": 1,
            "width": 6,
            "height": 3
          },
          "linkedEntityGuids": null,
          "visualization": {
            "id": "viz.table"
          },
          "rawConfiguration": {
            "facet": {
              "showOtherSeries": false
            },
            "nrqlQueries": [
              {
                "accountIds": [
                  2813435
                ],
                "query": "SELECT latest(version) AS 'Version', latest(cloud) AS 'Cloud', latest(region) AS 'Region', latest(application_name) AS 'Application', latest(compartment_name) AS 'Compartment' FROM Metric WHERE metricName = 'forwarder.invocations' AND function_name IN ({{function_name}}) SINCE 1 hour ago FACET function_name, tenancy_name LIMIT MAX"
              }
            ],
            "platformOptions": {
              "ignoreTimeRange": false
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "title": "Invocations",
          "layout": {
            "column": 7,
            "row": 4,
            "width": 3,
            "height": 3
          },
          "linkedEntityGuids": null,
          "visualization": {
            "id": "viz.billboard"
          },
          "rawConfiguration": {
            "facet": {
              "showOtherSeries": false
            },
            "nrqlQueries": [
              {
                "accountIds": [
                  2813435
                ],
                "query": "SELECT sum(`forwarder.invocations`) AS 'Total', filter(sum(`forwarder.invocations`), WHERE status = 'success') AS 'Success', filter(sum(`forwarder.invocations`), WHERE status = 'error') AS 'Error' FROM Metric WHERE function_name IN ({{function_name}})"
              }
            ],
            "platformOptions": {
              "ignoreTimeRange": false
            },
            "thresholds": [
              {
                "alertSeverity": "WARNING",
                "value": 0
              }
            ]
          }
        },
